WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:08.690
"I need help, Bot," Ringo said.

2
00:00:08.691 --> 00:00:12.817
"I can't find my favorite pen."

3
00:00:12.818 --> 00:00:16.293
Bot looked at Ringo's messy room.

4
00:00:16.294 --> 00:00:21.016
Stuff lay all over the floor.

5
00:00:21.017 --> 00:00:24.115
"I'll help," Bot said.

6
00:00:24.116 --> 00:00:30.146
"Your pen must be in here."

7
00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:41.511
Ringo and Bot looked everywhere.

8
00:00:41.512 --> 00:00:45.598
Ringo sat in his chair.

9
00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:49.315
"Maybe it's under here," he said.

10
00:00:49.316 --> 00:00:51.038
Ringo got up.

11
00:00:51.039 --> 00:01:01.928
He pushed the chair.

12
00:01:01.929 --> 00:01:04.848
A bug ran over his foot.

13
00:01:04.849 --> 00:01:09.672
"Ahh!" Ringo screamed.

14
00:01:09.673 --> 00:01:12.687
"What's wrong?" Bot asked.

15
00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:17.181
Ringo pointed at the tiny bug. "That!"

16
00:01:17.182 --> 00:01:23.181
Bot looked at the bug.

17
00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:26.359
"It's just a bug," she said.

18
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:30.468
"It's not a big deal."

19
00:01:30.469 --> 00:01:33.354
Ringo's face turned red.

20
00:01:33.355 --> 00:01:36.731
"You're right, Bot," he said.

21
00:01:36.732 --> 00:01:39.912
"That bug is so small.

22
00:01:39.913 --> 00:01:43.469
I feel silly."

23
00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:46.364
Bot patted Ringo on the shoulder.

24
00:01:46.365 --> 00:01:49.186
"Don't feel silly," she said.

25
00:01:49.187 --> 00:01:53.390
"Everybody gets scared sometimes."

26
00:01:53.391 --> 00:01:58.727
Ringo felt better. "Thanks, Bot."

27
00:01:58.728 --> 00:02:03.239
Lucy ran into the room. "What happened?

28
00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.854
I heard you scream."

29
00:02:05.855 --> 00:02:09.855
Ringo shrugged. "I saw a bug.

30
00:02:09.856 --> 00:02:12.719
It's not a big deal."

31
00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:20.878
Lucy laughed. "Tiny is scared of a bug!

32
00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:23.169
That's silly!"

33
00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:27.700
Ringo sighed.

